    "stdout": "\n> remote-paint-prototype@0.1.0 test\n> node --test tests/*.test.mjs\n\n\u2714 demand gates native encoding, permits only one in-flight capture and drops detached results (3.372709ms)\n\u2714 frame input watermark samples capture start rather than later encoding completion (1.809584ms)\n\u2714 dynamic source images really require the browser HttpOnly session cookie (27.205666ms)\n\u2714 strict session/page/viewport/lease/sequence checks prevent any CDP dispatch (1.436333ms)\n\u2714 handoff fences accepted Agent work, blocks new Agent work and releases held state (0.317167ms)\n\u2714 revocation invalidates queued input, fences inflight input and resumes Agent after cleanup (0.517583ms)\n\u2714 expiry and disconnect revoke authority; cleanup is allowed even when queue is full (40.805416ms)\n\u2714 input schema bounds coordinates and maps text, composition and editor shortcut to CDP (0.658625ms)\n\u2714 delta depends on the acknowledged base; missing resources/failed decode never advance the visible frame (1.245459ms)\n\u2714 coalesce unsent snapshots, compute a fresh delta from ACK, reuse bytes and recover with a complete keyframe (1.261333ms)\n\u2714 slow clients have one bounded window and reconnect to a new keyframe (36.137042ms)\n\u2714 resource header round trip preserves content; truncation, length and version are rejected (2.0785ms)\n\u2714 missing resource never replaces committed frame; a complete keyframe recovers (0.528792ms)\n\u2714 reject mismatched commits, stale epochs and dependent delta frames (1.207875ms)\n\u2714 do not free resources still referenced by a displayed or pending frame (0.38225ms)\n\u2714 refuse cache growth and unsupported composition before native decoding (0.5115ms)\n\u2714 CanvasKit replays Viz front-to-back order, target clips, scrolling transforms and opacity (12.378583ms)\n\u2714 CanvasKit composites an earlier render pass at its actual output origin (2.465291ms)\n\u2714 full pictures honor rebased tile origins after clipping in quad coordinates (4.21925ms)\n\u2714 transparent picture clears never punch through previously composed content (2.373875ms)\n\u2714 CanvasKit frees actual CPU surface pixel buffers across frames and render errors (43.164417ms)\n\u2714 map actual namespaced stable layer IDs; remapped Viz handles never identify content (1.420791ms)\n\u2714 release logical resources, and never reuse a released revision within an epoch (0.247292ms)\n\u2714 private length-prefixed Viz IPC correlates one requested frame and rejects unknown/oversize packets (9.227042ms)\n\u2714 rebased tile coordinates move full-layer content while retaining its immutable resource (0.277208ms)\n\u2714 transport rejects bad origin/key and mismatched Wasm; serves each client a complete snapshot (39.505708ms)\n\u2714 do not serve a capture whose resource has been modified (7.253875ms)\n\u2139 tests 27\n\u2139 suites 0\n\u2139 pass 27\n\u2139 fail 0\n\u2139 cancelled 0\n\u2139 skipped 0\n\u2139 todo 0\n\u2139 duration_ms 275.840875\n"
